  },
  {
    "id": "e8aab9af-e552-4647-9c61-329d19321978",
    "title": "Retro Pop",
    "prompt": "Vector flat illustration in retro pop-art style, inspired by 1950s–60s vintage comic-book printing. Use halftone-dot textures and a rough screen-print feel; thick, crisp black outlines; simple flattened shapes; and a cute, playful cartoon style.\n\nNo realistic 3D shading—use dense and sparse halftone dots to define light and dark areas. Use a limited, high-saturation colour palette; no gradients or intricate details. Keep it strictly 2D flat, with no text in the image.\n\nUse a pure-white, delicate paper-like background with natural grain, slightly imperfect hand-drawn strokes, and a handmade vintage-print character. Keep the composition clean, with no unnecessary clutter.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "733ea917-42e9-406c-993f-ff0a9763a13e.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 29,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-21T13:32:35.128Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-24T11:21:43.039Z",
    "categoryId": "89d3d50f-6ef4-437c-95c0-c799f8fb6440"
  },
  {
    "id": "c33e8052-072f-4b95-a689-62c08eb784bf",
    "title": "Real Person + Cartoon Companion",
    "prompt": "Fully preserve the original person — position unchanged, face, hairstyle, body proportions, clothing, pose, stance, and photo texture all unchanged; do not redraw or move the person. Keep the background, street greenery, lighting, and composition exactly as in the original, only adding new content into empty areas of the frame. Add a cartoon character into the empty area, with outfit/styling and pose direction matching the original person; the cartoon character's height should take up a large portion of the frame, standing on the left side, noticeably taller than the original person. Use a cute, flat, hand-drawn sticker-illustration style — thick black outlines with a soft light-yellow edge stroke, macaron flat coloring, round cute expressions with pink blush, in a travel-journal sticker style. Add playful hand-drawn doodle decorations around the person: small colorful flowers, hollow flower outlines, wavy lines, short arcs, spirals, loose brush strokes, and glowing lines, with bright colors, creating a summer-travel mood. The cartoon character should match the original photo's lighting/perspective and blend naturally with it. The overall effect: a real photo with an added cartoon-sticker character of matching pose/outfit but taller, plus hand-drawn decorations, layered on top; strictly forbidden to alter the original person or original background — only add the cartoon figure and doodles.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "925bfb9a-4a95-4e22-9100-a864119f5f33.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 28,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-22T02:09:26.396Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-24T11:21:43.039Z",
    "categoryId": "4ed760a1-09f7-4274-aa0d-83a30ca389db"
  },
  {
    "id": "3ca46f44-6fd7-4020-b3f5-ff50b972e344",
    "title": "Giant Hand-drawn Cat Hug",
    "prompt": "A giant hand-drawn cat gently hugs the real person from above | Use case: exaggerated, funny, eye-catching social-media image. Fully preserve the original person — position unchanged, face, hairstyle, body proportions, clothing, pose, stance, and photo texture all unchanged; do not redraw or move the person. Keep the background, street greenery, lighting, and composition exactly as in the original, only adding new content into empty areas of the frame. Add one very large hand-drawn cat into the empty area of the frame; the cat leans down from above or from the upper side and gently hugs the original person with its front paws — the gesture is exaggerated but gentle, like a giant plush cat suddenly appearing and hugging the real person. The cat should not press down on the person or cover their main facial features; the person must remain fully visible and clear. Draw the cat in a cute, flat, hand-drawn sticker-illustration style — thick black outlines, a soft light-yellow outer stroke, macaron flat coloring, a round cute expression, pink blush, and bright expressive eyes. Render cat ears, whiskers, tail, and fur with simple hand-drawn lines; the overall feel should have the relaxed charm of a travel-journal sticker/doodle illustration. Add playful hand-drawn doodle decorations around the person: small colorful flowers, hollow flower outlines, wavy lines, short arcs, spirals, loose brush strokes, glowing lines, cat paw prints, little stars, and heart shapes, with bright colors and a cute, playful mood. The added cat needs to match the original photo's perspective, angle, and lighting, blending naturally with it. The overall effect: a real photo where a giant, cute, hand-drawn cat gently hugs the person from above. Do not generate: any change to the original person, moving the person, redrawing the person, changing the face/hairstyle/clothing/pose, changing the background/street greenery/lighting, turning the person into an illustration, a realistic cat, a fierce/aggressive cat expression, an injured-looking person, threatening/dangerous poses, covered facial features, or a cluttered image.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "aed7d2c6-5db1-488a-80ce-23eec38df891.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 27,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-22T02:09:46.271Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-24T11:21:43.039Z",
    "categoryId": "4ed760a1-09f7-4274-aa0d-83a30ca389db"
  },
  {
    "id": "d732757f-2fbf-4ac8-a929-a4b30fd66325",
    "title": "Sticker Doodle",
    "prompt": "Transform the person as if a child stuck stickers on them and then scribbled over it. Rounded silhouette, exaggerated proportions, keep the original pose, but hands, feet, clothes, and face are simplified into naive, childlike shapes. Surround the image with wobbly little stars, hearts, food icons, arrows, and scrawled handwritten text. Coloring is uneven, as if quickly applied with markers. Keywords: kids' stickers, round chibi shapes, casual sticker placement, naive shapes, wobbly handwriting, food icons, uneven coloring, loose scribbly doodle.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "11fc5447-616c-4d42-9cef-cc1bd6fc6dc5.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 26,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-22T02:10:03.520Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-24T11:21:43.039Z",
    "categoryId": "4ed760a1-09f7-4274-aa0d-83a30ca389db"
  },
  {
    "id": "60279a62-61ce-4676-8a4a-3a69301b380c",
    "title": "Crayon Sketch Doodle",
    "prompt": "Convert the photo's person into a playful, doodle-style sketch, keeping their original pose, hairstyle, clothing silhouette, and overall recognizability, while moderately exaggerating and distorting the facial features and expression. The overall look should feel like it was quickly and spontaneously drawn with cheap crayons or color markers — rough and messy, with the relaxed feel of raw hand-drawn art; proportions and perspective don't follow strict rules, and the lines look slightly clumsy. Outlines are loose and broken, with repeated strokes and overshooting lines typical of a rough draft; coloring is applied casually and unevenly, with irregular color-block edges and visible crayon texture. Pair with a simple cartoon-style background — simplified streets, trees, houses, etc. — with loose, sketchy lines that don't need much detail. Add common meme-style symbols where appropriate: question marks, exclamation marks, little stars, sweat-drop lines. The overall mood should be relaxed and humorous, with the casual spirit of an internet meme — as if dashed off spontaneously, not aiming for polish or completeness. Do not generate: photorealistic texture, refined heavy-paint illustration style, smooth and tidy vector lines, polished/beautified illustration, 3D cartoon characters, intricate detailed backgrounds, facial changes so drastic the person becomes unrecognizable, or commercial-poster quality.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "5dc56299-9c68-416b-a2d8-14f6fd7fff2f.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 25,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-22T02:10:18.827Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-24T11:21:43.039Z",
    "categoryId": "4ed760a1-09f7-4274-aa0d-83a30ca389db"
  },
  {
    "id": "c9f1a384-7472-42e4-a0b5-6b81067bd4b2",
    "title": "Soft Clay Figure",
    "prompt": "Convert the person in the photo into a soft, cute 3D clay-figure portrait, keeping their original pose, hairstyle, clothing silhouette, direction of motion, and overall vibe. Apply a slight 'cute-ification' to the proportions — a rounder head-to-body ratio — and simplify the facial features into a soft 3D expression, while still keeping the person recognizable. The material should resemble handmade clay or polymer clay, with a subtle fine texture on the surface, soft rounded edges, and clothing folds/hair rendered as simplified solid 3D shapes. Keep the overall color palette bright and soft, with clean diffuse lighting — no photorealistic rendering. The background can be simplified to a small display stand, a plain-colored backdrop, or a relaxed everyday scene; keep the composition uncluttered. The overall feeling should be cute, comforting, like a small clay figurine handmade specifically from this photo. Do not generate: photorealistic human texture, overly exaggerated chibi distortion, overly plastic-looking 3D modeling, completely altered facial features, changed pose, missing clothing, complex realistic backgrounds, a strong commercial-ad feel, or low recognizability.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "9c0e21f5-3d28-40e8-9065-6d1ee7d98dcc.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 24,
