  {
    "id": "378c6b79-c27f-4dbb-a9f3-1ceeb7973f8f",
    "title": "Witty Comic Strip",
    "prompt": "Convert this portrait photo into a single, funny comic-strip panel, keeping the person's facial features and pose, their original facial characteristics, hairstyle, clothing silhouette, and direction of motion — the main subject's identity must not change. The overall feel should be a loose, sketchy comic-strip draft, as if cut from a single frame of a lighthearted daily comic strip. Draw the person with thick black hand-drawn outlines — lines should be shaky, broken, with repeated strokes; avoid clean, tidy vector lines. Use flat coloring with simple, bright color blocks, allowing some color bleed, uneven edges, and visible hand-drawn traces. Exaggerate the expression — eyes, mouth, eyebrows, and facial muscles dramatically distorted — to convey shock, speechlessness, sudden excitement, a laugh-cry moment, or general comedic everyday vibe. Add classic comic-strip elements: speed lines, sound-effect text bubbles, sweat-drop lines, little shock symbols, exaggerated exclamation/question marks, halftone dots, and partial hatching. Keep the composition casual, like a spontaneously captured, memorable, funny moment — not too polished, not too complete, not too clean. The overall style should be relaxed, humorous, and full of everyday charm — a comic-strip-style portrait illustration that keeps the real person recognizable while placing them in an exaggerated comic scenario. Do not use heavy refined painting, realistic lighting, a clean undecorated look, over-beautification, photorealism, or a plain filter effect. Do not generate: refined heavy-paint style, realistic lighting, a clean undecorated image, plain illustration filters, over-beautification, photorealistic texture, 3D cartoon, an overly polished/pretty comic face, a complete detailed background, commercial-poster feel, low recognizability, missing facial features, changed pose, or the person turning into someone else.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "b22f7eae-e317-4166-b98d-ec9ab8ad8897.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 23,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-22T02:10:52.719Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-24T11:21:43.039Z",
    "categoryId": "89d3d50f-6ef4-437c-95c0-c799f8fb6440"
  },
  {
    "id": "ca88a710-b87f-4192-a72a-6f16396d55bf",
    "title": "Hand-drawn Sketch Portrait",
    "prompt": "Convert this portrait photo into a loose, casual hand-drawn sketch, based on the person's pose and facial features from the photo, using a shaky black ink pen to draw a single-line outline — lines are repeated and broken, imperfections aren't corrected, giving it the relaxed feel of a casual doodle. Apply light watercolor-marker coloring casually, letting the color bleed past the outlines with uneven color blocks. Add hand-drawn decorations in the empty areas of the image: explosion-style speech bubbles, handwritten stream-of-consciousness mood text, circled arrows, wavy lines, sweat-drop symbols, little ghosts, and heart doodles. Slightly and casually distort body proportions — don't use strict perspective. The overall mood should feel like an impromptu emotional doodle in a notebook — rough, lively, full of internet-meme charm. Do not generate: neat smooth line art, delicate realistic lighting, refined complete coloring, a clean clutter-free background, over-beautified subjects, photorealistic texture, 3D rendering effects, complex complete scenes, a commercial-illustration feel, or an overly cluttered image.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "9310b2be-6885-4f28-b857-feb9c4aae574.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 22,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-22T02:11:07.335Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-24T11:21:43.039Z",
    "categoryId": "4ed760a1-09f7-4274-aa0d-83a30ca389db"
  },
  {
    "id": "58fffb39-98fe-4b6b-b1da-a5ff55d7b02d",
    "title": "Cartoon Sticker",
    "prompt": "Cartoon sticker-style illustration with a crisp, thick black outline, bright flat coloring, and soft, simple shading. The portrait has a built-in white sticker border, with the scene scattered with torn tape pieces, geometric color blocks, hollow stars, and speech-bubble text. Slightly exaggerate the expression; the style should feel lively and bright, similar to trendy sticker illustrations on social platforms. Do not generate: gradient oil-painting texture, realistic skin texture, dark/dull color tones, heavy complex backgrounds, messy noise, delicate realistic hair, or realistic lighting/shading.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "imageFile": "e17c8138-77bb-4b39-82a0-b95378804873.jpg",
