  },
  {
    "id": "2291b1a2-9557-4c80-a7c7-ef769e90aa31",
    "title": "Architectural Blueprint Poster",
    "prompt": "Based on the uploaded photo of a building, create a flat, vector-style architectural illustration with the aesthetic of a data infographic. Precisely reproduce the building's overall silhouette, proportions, roof style, facade layering, and window/door layout. Remove all extraneous elements from the scene, sky, pedestrians, street greenery, and other clutter. Use pure white and light neutral tones as the base, with the building's front facade centered in the frame, following the symmetrical design logic of an architectural blueprint. Outline the form with crisp dark linework, filled with flat, even color blocks, accented with subtle light-and-shadow shading and delicate highlights, for a clean, premium, professional architectural-drafting look. Add a fitting style name in English in the upper-left corner, and layer large, semi-transparent light-gray text behind the building as an atmospheric background texture. Add dimension-marking lines appropriate to the building's scale: height values labeled along the side of tall buildings, and length/width data labeled at the base of elongated buildings, using an approximate-value marker for any unknown measurements. Add simple scale-ruler ticks to the image. Along the side, label the building's name, location, and construction date in vertical red text. Overall, the layout should suit an architecture-education poster or a professional surveying/drafting format, with neat, clean linework, a unified, understated, elegant color palette, and comfortable, premium white space.",
    "identityMode": "none",
    "categoryId": null,
    "imageFile": "7a1ad157-f76e-4293-9dfa-d3a124640cb0.jpg",
    "enabled": true,
    "order": 2,
    "createdAt": "2026-07-27T06:58:13.068Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-27T07:45:37.608Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "de15a6d7-04a8-4268-ba3f-1fd5a0502d0f",
    "title": "Miniature Postage Stamp",
    "prompt": "Transform the main landmark or subject in the photo into an ultra-detailed 3D miniature travel postage-stamp diorama. Have the landmark emerge in relief from a realistic postage stamp, floating against a vibrant orange studio background, viewed from an isometric perspective, with tiny figures walking around the scene. Add fluffy floating clouds casting soft shadows, cinematic lighting, photorealistic architecture, intricate city detail, and crystal-clear water reflections where relevant. Give it a luxury travel-ad quality, like a collectible miniature world, with a tilt-shift photography look and hyperrealistic textures, in a premium travel-poster design with a travel-postcard aesthetic. Integrate clean lettering into the stamp's border, with a fitting destination name in bold modern type and a short tagline beneath it. Emphasize a sense of depth-and-scale illusion, evoking a spirit of global exploration. Render it with award-winning 3D quality: global illumination, ray tracing, ultra-sharp focus, vivid colors, and 8K masterpiece detail. Preserve the recognizable identity of the main subject or landmark from the photo.",
    "identityMode": "none",
    "categoryId": "38d3befa-39e5-47d4-bf0b-a140792b2ac3",
    "imageFile": "6917bf91-3fbf-467a-a9e7-01963d0f8af3.jpg",
