  {
    "id": "21aef128-6cb9-482d-bc3d-75f387c665c2",
    "title": "Coin Relief Medallion",
    "prompt": "Reimagine the person as a profile portrait minted into a classical coin or medallion, preserving their facial structure, hairstyle silhouette, and expression so they remain recognizable, adapted into a dignified side-profile bust pose typical of minted coinage. Render the entire image as a single uniform metal material, aged bronze, silver, or gold, with a raised relief surface: the portrait should appear physically embossed and three-dimensional, catching light along raised edges with darker recessed shadows in the grooves. Remove all color from skin, hair, and clothing, unifying everything into the metal's tone and patina. Add a circular coin border around the portrait, with a decorative rim design, and leave space for small ornamental engraved flourishes or laurel-leaf motifs along the edge. Light it dramatically from one side to emphasize the embossed relief texture. Preserve the person's recognizable facial profile and hairstyle silhouette throughout. Do not generate: full color, a frontal non-profile pose, photographic skin texture, or loss of the person's recognizable identity.",
    "identityMode": "reinforced",
    "categoryId": "38d3befa-39e5-47d4-bf0b-a140792b2ac3",
